  sentence punctuation, and about 4 when it follows a closing tool tag.
- `<|im_start|>` opens a turn: about 3.3 after a newline, about 0 after `<|endoftext|>`.
- Other markers (`<tool_call>`, `</think>`, `<think>`, `<tool_response>`, ...) have a
  fixed typical value.
