Punctuation-bound pieces and short consonant-P abbreviations also respond.
P in an uppercase run and p continuing a word respond less strongly;
letters near the document's beginning respond more strongly. Smaller
responses cover Cyrillic pe and Greek capital pi. Most other tokens are
zero: this is not a dictionary of their incidental background activations.
