"""Use current-token strength and quality words as a coarse activation proxy.

Strong/weak terms get a larger positive guess; a wider English/Chinese force,
degree, and quality vocabulary gets a smaller one. Other tokens get zero.
This is a sparse lexical cue, not a context-aware semantic classifier.
"""

